atchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f5/kg4rhty6u1adr7q2g7qp9xy4mgyvtnu.png/75px-%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E4%BA%BA%E7%89%A9_%E5%8F%B6%E5%A5%88%E6%B3%95.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"94\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f5/kg4rhty6u1adr7q2g7qp9xy4mgyvtnu.png/113px-%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E4%BA%BA%E7%89%A9_%E5%8F%B6%E5%A5%88%E6%B3%95.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f5/kg4rhty6u1adr7q2g7qp9xy4mgyvtnu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a>\n</th></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>以上角色在卫队试炼的出场率极高，可极大地降低通关难度。\n</p><p><br /><font size=\"4\"><b>视频攻略</b></font><br />\n1-12关较容易，拥有以上明星单卡以及机制特异性对策卡便可轻松过关（当然了我们也非常欢迎主动投搞的热心群众）<br />\n13-16纳入高难关范畴，以下是视频攻略及简易文字攻略：（by Azhar）<br />\n卫队试炼13 沙漠队3回合:<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1hZ64BfEJi/\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1hZ64BfEJi/</a><br />\ntips：①安娜是一切冰原怪物的对策卡 ②黑熊神力 ③灵活运用推拉 ④奶龙直接上亲王砍<br />\n卫队试炼14 黑熊3回合:<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV17PFDzXEZ3/\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV17PFDzXEZ3/</a><br />\ntips：黑熊带诡诈之影<a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%AF%A1%E8%AF%88%E4%B9%8B%E5%BD%B1\" title=\"装备图鉴库/诡诈之影\"><img alt=\"装备 诡诈之影.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/16/m6dfm71lzimuhvrd6sjynvrf23fcx1x.png/25px-%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87_%E8%AF%A1%E8%AF%88%E4%B9%8B%E5%BD%B1.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/16/m6dfm71lzimuhvrd6sjynvrf23fcx1x.png/38px-%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87_%E8%AF%A1%E8%AF%88%E4%B9%8B%E5%BD%B1.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/16/m6dfm71lzimuhvrd6sjynvrf23fcx1x.png/50px-%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87_%E8%AF%A1%E8%AF%88%E4%B9%8B%E5%BD%B1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a>可以防嘲讽debuff <br />\n卫队试炼15 中低配放心抄：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1fAFDzpEuo/\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1fAFDzpEuo/</a><br />\ntips：①必需品：1星及以上龙虾壳<a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%B2%9C%E8%A1%80%E5%92%92%E9%93%A0%E2%80%9C%E6%B3%95%E5%A4%AB%E7%BA%B3%E2%80%9D\" title=\"装备图鉴库/鲜血咒铠“法夫纳”\"><img alt=\"装备 鲜血咒铠“法夫纳”.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/bb/1erv3wt6wvf9qp1gb78c2oa10z052pe.png/25px-%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87_%E9%B2%9C%E8%A1%80%E5%92%92%E9%93%A0%E2%80%9C%E6%B3%95%E5%A4%AB%E7%BA%B3%E2%80%9D.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/bb/1erv3wt6wvf9qp1gb78c2oa10z052pe.png/38px-%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87_%E9%B2%9C%E8%A1%80%E5%92%92%E9%93%A0%E2%80%9C%E6%B3%95%E5%A4%AB%E7%BA%B3%E2%80%9D.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/bb/1erv3wt6wvf9qp1gb78c2oa10z052pe.png/50px-%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87_%E9%B2%9C%E8%A1%80%E5%92%92%E9%93%A0%E2%80%9C%E6%B3%95%E5%A4%AB%E7%BA%B3%E2%80%9D.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a>、至少一个飞刃臂套<a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%A3%9E%E5%88%83%E8%87%82%E5%A5%97\" title=\"装备图鉴库/飞刃臂套\"><img alt=\"装备 飞刃臂套.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/61/hibuma2680l4gy0bnxlr2ivvwu058ql.png/25px-%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87_%E9%A3%9E%E5%88%83%E8%87%82%E5%A5%97.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/61/hibuma2680l4gy0bnxlr2ivvwu058ql.png/38px-%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87_%E9%A3%9E%E5%88%83%E8%87%82%E5%A5%97.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/61/hibuma2680l4gy0bnxlr2ivvwu058ql.png/50px-%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87_%E9%A3%9E%E5%88%83%E8%87%82%E5%A5%97.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a> ②伊南娜和叶奈法带女皇的优雅塔罗<img alt=\"塔罗 女皇的优雅.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e9/nc9wtdxvotaavkxi7qaxgvziii49ktt.png/25px-%E5%A1%94%E7%BD%97_%E5%A5%B3%E7%9A%87%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%98%E9%9B%85.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e9/nc9wtdxvotaavkxi7qaxgvziii49ktt.png/38px-%E5%A1%94%E7%BD%97_%E5%A5%B3%E7%9A%87%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%98%E9%9B%85.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e9/nc9wtdxvotaavkxi7qaxgvziii49ktt.png/50px-%E5%A1%94%E7%BD%97_%E5%A5%B3%E7%9A%87%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%98%E9%9B%85.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /> ③低练度安娜，小索带猎手的直觉<a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%8C%8E%E6%89%8B%E7%9A%84%E7%9B%B4%E8%A7%89\" title=\"装备图鉴库/猎手的直觉\"><img alt=\"装备 猎手的直觉.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/6a/pljylpkhssemq7dojm72sul1zw26mho.png/25px-%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87_%E7%8C%8E%E6%89%8B%E7%9A%84%E7%9B%B4%E8%A7%89.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/6a/pljylpkhssemq7dojm72sul1zw26mho.png/38px-%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87_%E7%8C%8E%E6%89%8B%E7%9A%84%E7%9B%B4%E8%A7%89.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/6a/pljylpkhssemq7dojm72sul1zw26mho.png/50px-%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87_%E7%8C%8E%E6%89%8B%E7%9A%84%E7%9B%B4%E8%A7%89.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a>和警戒技能<br /> \n卫队试炼16 下次还填非常简单：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ac68BvEuc/\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ac68BvEuc/</a><br />\ntips：警戒流杀疯了。<br />\n<br /><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF162.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"官方消息162.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d6/svw1kgm80z16l73m4cyr5qbzzppqu7h.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"200\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" /></a><br />\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"BILIBILI-BOX BOX-4\" style=\"\"><div class=\"BOX-2-1\" style=\"\"><div class=\"BOX-title-1\"><center><img alt=\"虎牙.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f4/fmmwqdn1nz9wzix61lnglkrobf9gw9e.png/25px-%E8%99%8E%E7%89%99.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f4/fmmwqdn1nz9wzix61lnglkrobf9gw9e.png/38px-%E8%99%8E%E7%89%99.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f4/fmmwqdn1nz9wzix61lnglkrobf9gw9e.png/50px-%E8%99%8E%E7%89%99.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />冰原之心_门内主线关卡<img alt=\"虎牙.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f4/fmmwqdn1nz9wzix61lnglkrobf9gw9e.png/25px-%E8%99%8E%E7%89%99.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f4/fmmwqdn1nz9wzix61lnglkrobf9gw9e.png/38px-%E8%99%8E%E7%89%99.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f4/fmmwqdn1nz9wzix61lnglkrobf9gw9e.png/50px-%E8%99%8E%E7%89%99.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><center></center></center></div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle\" style=\"display: block !important; text-align: left !important; width: 100% !important; padding: 12px 15px !important; background: rgb(240 236 226 / 70%) !important; color: black !important; border-radius: 5px !important; cursor: pointer !important; font-weight: bold !important; margin-bottom: 10px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; border: 1px solid #ccc !important;\">\n<p><span class=\"mw-collapsible-text\">▼ 点击展开/收起本期内容</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\" style=\"padding-top: 10px;\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N\" style=\"\">\n<p><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E4%BC%8A%E5%87%A1_%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"伊凡 活动.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/7a/ascd4buijbqu4r3hyyll76dmzbf43zj.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1400\" height=\"164\" data-file-width=\"1400\" data-file-height=\"164\" /></a>\n<br /><font size=\"4\"><b>视频攻略</b></font><br />\n<br />【by 蛙腿二】<br />\n第八幕 穿越虫群：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1SfAAznEXJ\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1SfAAznEXJ</a><br />\ntips:此关虽然没有额外任务，但敌人数量较多，有同学反映可能需要攻略因此也放在这里~<br />\n第十七幕额外任务：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1C8AAzgEoW\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1C8AAzgEoW</a><br />\ntips:我方角色需提前走到栅栏附近。此关杀完怪物以后会迅速触发霜狼事件，两个平民容易被敌方吃再动打死。<br />\n第三十五幕之二额外任务：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1B6AAzYE5Y\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1B6AAzYE5Y</a><br />\n<br />【by 今咨嗟以叹余生】<br />\n铃兰之剑新门内冰原之心（懒人速通版）：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1GbQzBtEjz\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1GbQzBtEjz</a><br />\ntips:覆盖面最广的攻略，包含所有关卡的自动or额外目标的打法攻略，懒人最爱。<br />\n<br /><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF162.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"官方消息162.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d6/svw1kgm80z16l73m4cyr5qbzzppqu7h.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"200\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" /></a><br />\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"BILIBILI-BOX BOX-4\" style=\"\"><div class=\"BOX-2-1\" style=\"\"><div class=\"BOX-title-1\"><center><img alt=\"虎牙.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f4/fmmwqdn1nz9wzix61lnglkrobf9gw9e.png/25px-%E8%99%8E%E7%89%99.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f4/fmmwqdn1nz9wzix61lnglkrobf9gw9e.png/38px-%E8%99%8E%E7%89%99.p